<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,323.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,323.</headline>
<text>
<p>Spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,323 today from 1,311 on Oct 31, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route			   Index    Rate    Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1   US GULF/ARA	  1560    14.163    1566    14.214</p>
