<p>   2   US GULF/JAPAN	1676    23.950    1637    23.393</p>
<p>   2a  SKAW P/USG/F EAST  1590 13038.000    1588 13021.000</p>
<p>   3   NOPAC/JAPAN	  1428    13.175    1403    12.943</p>
